<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">MAHEVERU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dyo ku Maheveru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maheveru</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mahev</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dyo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maheveru</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu po Mwana Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Kukare, Nyambi wa ambire rorungi, karo ko makuñwa oangi kakwakukethza kwakwathsañuruetu. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Uno honi mo ano mayuwa o mahurerero na a amba ku kwetu ka Mwane, aye oyu a hangurire Nyambi kwikara shwana wenu yoihe, karo kenthzi aye, Nyambi wombire enu yoihe. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Aye Mwana yodiyo diyeye dyo kutethzima kwa Nyambi nedi ekara shemwa Nyambi, yodiyo na kwata enu yoihe ko diywi dyenthzi dyodikoro. Ou a manine ku tu kenithsa kwivi yetu, wa thzire mu wiru no ku kekara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi Shokuru mu wiru. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Eyi yaa monithsa ci Mwana naa tendiwa o mukuru kupita tungeru, inene dithzina edi naa piwa po dikuru kupita mathzina o tungeru.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana po mukuru ku tungeru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Inene kapi ku tungeru aka a amberapo Nyambi ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“O mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">rero ni na piruka Tata woe”?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Nji karo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Kenge na kwikara Tata wenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">karo kenge a kwikara Mwanange”?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Unone Nyambi ou a retire mwedi wenthzi mu kaye wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Tungeru twa Nyambi totuhe tu mu rombere.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Keyi yo tungeru aa amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Aa tenda tungeru twenthzi eci mipepo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">karo aa tenda akwakukwamenthzi eci mirengi.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Unone keyi ya Mwana aa amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Ngunja thzoe, Nyambi, thza diyere na diyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Waa tumina ko muramu owawa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Waa shima owawa no ku thzimba omango.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Mweyo, Nyambi, aye Nyambi woe, na ku hangura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ko ku ku wethsa maathzi o thsinyanyu kupita aenthzoe.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Karo aa amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Yowe Fumu, oyu wa shishire mushisho o kaye ku matatekero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">karo diwiru po ekwama yo moko oe.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Kenge ya ku pwa, unone owe kenge wa kwikara diyere.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Yoihe kenge ya ku kurupara eci thsito,<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Kenge wa ku i funda eci vaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">karo kenge ya ku cinjiwa eci eto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Unone owe kenge wa kwikarerera kengeyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">karo myaka thzoe mbera ka thzi pu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Kapi ku tungeru aka a amberapo Nyambi ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“O wikare ku dyoko dyange dyo rudyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">shime ku ka kuma apa na ku tendera akwethzimbo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">yoe thsipura thsedyato yoe?”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Mweyo, tungeru po mipepo pohuma ethzi thzi kwamena Nyambi, karo thzaa tumiwanga ku na kwamena awa ku tambura kuyoyithsiwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa pomekithsa oku kuyoyithsiwa kokukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Mweyo, twaa roera ku tanarithsa nene eyi na tu yuvu ci katere tu yemburuke. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Inene ngeci muthzimbu ou wa piwire ko tungeru wa koropire, karo munu yomuhe oyu wa u corire no kukana ku u shupwera wa piwire humbithso ethzi thza mu roerire ne, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />ngepi twa ku para ngeci twaa pomekithsa oku kuyoyithsiwa kokukuru? Fumu aye thsinda yodiyo wa tangire ku ku raura oku kuyoyithsiwa, ngou honi a i tu tongwerire awa mu yuvire. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nyambi wa pire ombangi o o muthzimbu ko ku pa emonithso, yo ku komokithsa nekomokithsa, karo nepa yo Mupepo Oukenu eyi i na eriwa kwanu komu a na shimena aye.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wa tendiwire munu shemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Mweyo kadi cingwa tungeru a pire Nyambi ku endithsa kaye aka ka keya, aka tu ambaura yako. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Unone kumweya mu Mañoro yumweya wa pire ombangi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Nyambi, munu ne thsine ci o mu anekere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">mwana munu ne thsine ci o mu pakere maano?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Owe wa mu pakire kushi thzo tungeru kamanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">no ku mu pa mushukwe o kutethzima no direma.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Karo owe wa mu pire ku endithsa enu yoihe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Yoihe ku ambiwa ci “enu yoihe” yaa amba ci kwithsa ethsi thsi na thsiiwako. Uno honi tu shime ku mona enu yoihe o ku i na pakiwa mushi thzenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Unone twaa mona Yesu, oyu wa pakiwire kamanana mu ndau thzo kushi thzo tungeru, na a piwa mushukwe o kutethzima no direma pakuninga ci wa fire, ci ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi nga a fere anu wahe.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Mu kureta ana owangi mu kutethzima, yoshemwa ya roerire ci aye Nyambi oyu i nekarerako no kwikarako kenthzi enu yoihe, a tende Yesu kwikara o ku kwanenena ko makando aa a nyandire. Inene Yesu po yodiyo na wa tangerera ku wa twara ku kuyoyithsiwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Inene Yesu oyu kenithsa anu kwivi yo, nowa a kenithsiwa, wahe a di no Tata wo yofoci. Eyo ngeyi a kanena ku fa honyi Yesu ku wethsa ci aminenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Wa amberire Nyambi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Kenge na ku ka raura yo dithzina dyoe kwaenthzange.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Kenge na ku ku shangara apa a na konganena anuoe.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Wa ambire karo ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Kenge na ku mu kurupera.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Karo ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Yamono nana awa na a ni pa Nyambi.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci awa ana aa kwamiwa pa nyama nonyinga, Yesu naye wekarire nyama nonyinga, ci ko ku fa nga a pwithse oyu na kwata okoro o kufa, aye shamaonga, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />ci nga a rukurure wahe awa a na yoyo mwoyo wo ouhe mupika o ku yapa kufa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Inene yoshemwa kadi cingwa tungeru a na kwathsa, unone aa kwathsa anahoka a Aburahama. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Mweyo, ya roerire ci shime a tendiwe eci aenthzenthzi, kwikara munu shemwa mwinu yoihe, ci nga ekare Mupurisita Shokuru o ñeke norurami mwikwama ya Nyambi, ci nga a twethse ku tupura thsiyambero thso ku tundithsa evi yanu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Pakuninga ci aye naa nyanda no ku tumauriwa, aa twethsa ku tu kwathsa yoihe tu tumauriwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pita Mushe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Mweyo, andengenu, amwe mwana Nyambi, amwe mu na citapera mu kwithsiwa ko ku wiru, mu pakere maano koyu Yesu, oyu tu citawera ci kanganda ka Nyambi, karo mupurisita shokuru wetu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Inene wa ruramine kwa Nyambi, oyu wa mu hangurire, eci dyodi a ruramine Mushe mu nthzio thza Nyambi thzothzihe.<verse eid="HEB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Unone Yesu po aa roera kutethzima kokukuru kupita Mushe, eci dyodi i di ci mukwakuumba nthzio aa roera ku shangariwa nene kupita athzo nthzio. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Inene nthzio no nthzio kwaa di oyu wa thzi umba, unone mukwakuumba enu yoihe po Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mushe aye wa ruramine mu nthzio thza Nyambi thzothzihe ko kwikara ngamba, ku pa ombangi wenu eyi ya ku ambiwa ku rupara. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Uno honi Krisitu aye ko kwikara Mwana Nyambi, aa endithsa nthzio thza Nyambi thzothzihe korurami. Atwe yatwe twa nthzio thza Nyambi, ngeci atwepo tu ndumepa no ku tawa shemwa mukurupero wetu omu tu cishangarera.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuturumwithsa kwanua Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Mweyo, eci edi a amba Mupepo Oukenu ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Rero nga amwepo mu yuva diywi dyenthzi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />mwa karupithsa micima thzenu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">eci diya a tendire akwathsañuruenu uya a ni pirukerire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">diya diyuwa a ni erekire mu dikunguthsitu.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Omu a ni erekerire akwathsañuruenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">shaanga ci a monine ekwama yange mu myaka thzo makumi ane.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Mweyo, na wa anthziperire, no ku amba ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Micima thzo thsikati thsothsihe thzaa yemburukanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ka na dimuka makuñwa ange.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Mukaci ko kuanthzipa kwange, nethzire ngoro ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Mbera kengena mu kuturumwithsa kwange.’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Mweyo, andengenu, mu mamere ci ku kwenu kwa waniwa munu o mucima oumango, mucima o kukana ku tawa ou u mu twara kokure na Nyambi oyu yoya. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Uno honi, mu citanarithsire oandu namweya diyuwa no diyuwa, o ku shimbi yekarera ci “rero,” ci kwa kwikara shaanga yofoci oyu wa kwikara no mukanayuva mukaci ko kwangeriwa ku thsivi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Inene twahe twaa ciera mwa Krisitu, ngeci atwepo tu tanarithsa thsitawo ethsi twekarire nathso ku matatekero shime ku ka kuma ku mamaneneno. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nga amwepo mu yuva diywi dyenthzi rero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">mwa karupithsa micima thzenu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">eci diya a tendire akwathsañuruenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">uya a pirukerire Nyambi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Adye waya a yuvire diywi dya Nyambi unone a mu pirukerire? Kadi wodiyo waya wahe a tangererire Mushe ku tunda mu Egepita? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Karo adye awa a anthziperire Nyambi myaka thzo makumi ane? Ene kadi waya anu a tendire thsivi, karo ethzimbi yo ya dyadyamine mu dikunguthsitu? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Karo adye awa ethzerire ngoro Nyambi ci mbera kengena mu kuturumwithsa kwenthzi? Ene kadi waya a mu pirukerire? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Mweyo, twaa mona ci ka twethsire kwingena mu kuturumwithsa kwenthzi mukaci ko kukana kwo ku tawa.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikumbwethzo thso kuturumwithsa kwanua Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci thsikumbwethzo thso kwingena omu mu kuturumwithsa shimbi thsekarerako, tu yapenu ci kwa kwikara yumweya ku kwenu oyu wa ku kwanga ku kumamo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Inene ou Muthzimbu Ouwa na u hongiwa ku kwetu, eci dyodi yekarire kowaya ekarire mu dikunguthsitu. Unone kwithsa eyi wa wa kwathsire, inene kekarire no thsitawo thso ku ninga eci thso waya a yuverire Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Mweyo, atwe na tu tawa twaengena muya mu kuturumwithsa, eci dyodi a ambire Nyambi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Na anthzipire no kwethza ngoro ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Mbera kengena mu kuturumwithsa kwange.’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Wa ambire kengeyo, shaanga ikare ci ekwama yenthzi ya pwire ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Inene mu Mañoro ko ku di oku a ambire yo diyuwa dyo muthsitanu naedi ci: “Mu diyuwa dyo muthsitanu naedi Nyambi wa turumwithsire kwikwama yenthzi yoihe.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Eyo karo yaa waniwa kumweya oku a amba Nyambi ci: “Mbera kengena mu kuturumwithsa kwange.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Mweyo, kuturumwithsa kwa Nyambi shimbi kwekarerako ci anu amweya engenemo. Uno honi awa tangire ku hongiwa oo Muthzimbu Ouwa a kwangire kwingenamo mukaci ko kukana kwo ku yuvera Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Mweyo, Nyambi wa pakire diyuwa dimweya edi di nethsiwa ci “Rero.” Nyambi wa ambire ka Davida yedi diyuwa ku kare munyima thzo myaka thzothzingi, eci edi i di mu maywi aa a na ambiwa kare ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Nga amwepo mu yuva diywi dyenthzi rero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">mwa karupithsa micima thzenu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Inene ngeci po Joshua wa wa pire kuturumwithsa, Nyambi nga ka a ambire karo yo diyuwa dimweya munyima. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Mweyo, shimbi dyekarerako diyuwa dyo kuturumwithsa kwanua Nyambi eci edi a turumwithsire Nyambi mu diyuwa dyo muthsitanu na edi. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Inene yomuhe o kwingena mu kuturumwithsa kwa Nyambi aa turumwithsa kwikwama yenthzi, eci dyodi a turumwithsire Nyambi kwikwama yenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Mweyo, tu erekenu momuhe omu tu na twethsera ci twingene omo mu kuturumwithsa, ci kwa kwikara oyu wa ku kwanga ku kengenamo eci diya yekarire kowaya ekarire mu dikunguthsitu, awa kwangire kwingena mu kuturumwithsa mukaci ko kukana kwo ku yuvera Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Inene diywi dya Nyambi dyaa yoya, karo dikoro. Ditwe kupita mwere o ku waa nokunoku. Dyaengena mu kaci ko mwoyo no mupepo, mu kaci ko manunga eshoko no mupopo. Dyaa nangura eanekera necikumbwethza yo mucima o munu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kwithsa ku yumbiwa ethsi thsi na horekiwa kwa Nyambi. Enu yoihe pa mwanjanja i di, i na thsikuriwa pa meho enthzi, karo ku kwenthzi kodiyo twa ku ka citawera.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aye Mupurisita Shokuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci tu di no Mupurisita Shokuru oyu naa thzini mu wiru, aye Yesu Mwana Nyambi, tu tanarithsenu eyi na tu tawa. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Inene Mupurisita Shokuru wetu tumba nga a kwanga ku tu yuvera ñekeñeke mu kufaratera kwetu, inene wa tumauriwire mwitumaura yoihe omu tu pita, unone ka a tendire thsivi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Tu henyenenu kondume ku ngunja thza Nyambi thzo thsihemo, ci nga tu yuveriwe ñeke no ku wana thsihemo thso ku tu kwathsa mu thsikati thsekarupa.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Mupurisita Shokuru yomuhe aa hanguriwanga mu kaci kanu ci a kwamene Nyambi mu ndau thzo mwinu yo ku pitera kwa Nyambi, kupa nupu neyambero mukaci kevi yo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Mupurisita aa twethsa kuwamucima kwakwa kupira odimukero nakwa muyemburuko inene naye munu o kufaratera. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Pakuninga ci naye munu o ku faratera, aa roera ku pa thsiyambero thsevi yenthzi no ku pa eyambero yevi ya yanu.<figure style="fig" alt="High Priest" file="lb00266b.tif" size="col" loc="Heb 5:1-3" copy="Knowles" ref="5.1-3">Mupurisita Shokuru</figure><verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Karo kwithsa o kucihangwera edi direma dyo kwikara mupurisita shokuru, unone aa di wana pohuma ko kwithsiwa kwa Nyambi, eci edi ekarire Aroni. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Mofoci, no Krisitu naye ka a cithzinekire ci ekare mupurisita shokuru. Unone Nyambi wa mu amberire ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Yowe o mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Rero ni na piruka Tata woe.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Nyambi wa ambire karo kumweya ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Yowe o mupurisita o diyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">mu shayo thza Melekisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu ou a yoyire pano pa kaye, wekarire munu werombero no ku cidirerera ko ku kuana no mihothzi kwa Nyambi oyu wa twethsire ku mu yoyithsa ku kufa. Nyambi wa mu yuvire, inene shime a cihuthsire kushi. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Shaanga ci nedi Mwana Nyambi, wa cirongithsire ku yuvera Nyambi mu makando aa ekarire nao. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Munyima thzo ku tendiwa o kwononoka, wekarire oyu retera kuyoyithsiwa ko diyere wahe awa mu yuvera. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Nyambi wa mu tendire kwikara mupurisita shokuru mu shayo thza Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuturura mukaci ko ku thsia thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tu di neyi yoingi yo ku amba keyi, unone ikaru ku i mi tongonwena mukaci kokata wenu mu ku yuvithsithsa. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Kare mwandire o ku mu di akwakutawa, mwaa roera ci namwe nga mwaa rongithsa anu amweya. Unone kwaa fotahara munu ku na mi rongithsa erongithsa yo matatekero yo maywi a Nyambi. Amwe po mwaa roera mahwe kadi edya yoikoro. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Inene munu yomuhe o ku yoya mahwe po ka a dimukire thsirongithsa thsowawa, pakuninga ci shimbi ekarera kambu. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Unone edya yoikoro po yakuru, awa na cifundithsa ku hangura yoiwa kweyi yoimango.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Mweyo, tu tundenu mwirongithsa yo matatekero keyi ya Krisitu, tu tware ku rupara tu pye mwirongithsa keyi ya Krisitu. Ka tu roerire ku tateka karo ku shisha mushisho o kucera etenda yo ku twara ku kufa no ku tawa kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Ka mu roerire karo ku rongithsiwa yo makorovethzo, yo kukambekiwa moko, nji yo kupinduka kwafu no raturo thzo diyere. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Tu twarenu ku rupara! Karo eyi kenge twa ku i kwama ngeci Nyambi waa i tawethze.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Inene tumba i tawa ku ka huthsa anu ku kucera awa na tundu mu thsitawo, awa na tanga ku munekiwera, awa na ereka ku thsipa thso mu wiru no ku eriwa ku Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Na dimuka owa o diywi dya Nyambi nokoro o kaye aka ka keya. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Uno honi na tundu mu thsitawo, tumba i tawa ku wa huthsa ku kucera karo, inene awo athsinda aa pamarera karo Mwana Nyambi pa mbinda no ku mu fithsa honyi ku mbunga.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Muve ou u na yamwa meyu o mvura oyu na rokerangapo no ku retera njimi dicora dyodiwawa, waa tambura thsiyauthzi kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Unone muve o ku menithsa miunga no kanyamukombwe ka u kwathsire thsimweya. Nyambi kenge a ku u kuta wangu, ku mahurerero kenge wa ku tumekiwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ashimiwa ange, shaanga ou tu amba kenge, tu na dimuka shemwa ci amwe po mwaa tenda enu yoiwa nene, enu yo ku pitera ku kuyoyithsiwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nyambi po ka a wana dipethso, ka a ku vurama ekwama eyi na mu mu kwamena no thsishimo ethsi na mu mu monithsa ou na mu kwathsa anuenthzi, no rerodino ko ku tenda mu tenda kengeyo. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Twaa fota nene ci munu no munu ku kwenu a twarerere ku koñomeka ku tenda kengeyo shime ku ka kuma ku mamaneneno, ci eyi mu na kurupera i tendahare ko kuyara. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ka tu fotire ci mu vape, unone twaa fota ci mu taminene awa a di no thsitawo no kukwatamucima shime ku ka kuma apa a ku wa pera Nyambi eyi a wa kumbwethzire.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikumbwethzo thsa Nyambi thsaa reta okurupero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nyambi ou a kumbwethzire Aburahama, wa cethzerire mu dithzina dyenthzi aye Nyambi thsinda pakuninga ci kwithsa o mukuru ku mu pita oyu nga a cethzerire mu dithzina dyenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Wa ambire ci: “Yoshemwa kenge na ku ku fiyawera no ku ku pa anahoka owangi.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Aburahama wa tatererire ko ku kwata mucima, mweyo, wa tamburire eyi a mu kumbwethzire Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Inene anu a ethzanga ngoro mu dithzina dyo thsinu thsothsikuru mu thsivaka kupita awo athsinda, eyi anu a i tendanga ku tanarithsa eyi i na ambiwa no ku mana dikanyi mu kaciko. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Inene Nyambi shime a fotire ci awa roerire ku tambura thsikumbwethzo thsenthzi a dimuke shemwa ci ka a ku tuturura eyi a anekerire ku tenda, ngou a i tanarithsire ko kucethzera ngoro. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Nyambi na a pa thsikumbwethzo thsenthzi no kucethzera kwenthzi. Eyi enu idi tumba i piruriwa inene tumba i tawa ci Nyambi angere. Mweyo, atwe na tu cirera ku kwenthzi ci tu wane macirero twaa twethsa ku tanarithsiwa micima uno tu tanarithsa okurupero ou tu di nao. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Ou okurupero po ukoro, karo odiyo dinjanga dyo myoyo thzetu, ukoro karo waa kuruperiwa. Waengena mu Tembere no ku ka piterera dimbatu ku kengena mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Modiyo naa citangethza Yesu ku kengenamo mu ndau thzetu. Yodiyo mupurisita shokuru o diyere mu shayo thza Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mupurisita Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melekisedeki po nedi fumu o thsikuña thsa Salema, karo nedi mupurisita wa Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene. Aburahama ou a ka tundire ku mvo oku a ka thzirithsire mafumu, Melekisedeki wa mu hanganine no ku mu fiyawera. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Aburahama wa mu pire thso mudikumi kwinu yoihe eyi ekarire nayo. Thso kutanga, edi dithzina dyo Melekisedeki dyaa amba ci: “Fumu owawa.” Ku tunda apo, yodiyo karo fumu wa Salema, ku amba ci: “Fumu o thsiyaro.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi no dihumo dyenthzi ka ya dimukiwire, matatekero no mamaneneno o mwoyo wenthzi ka ya dimukiwire. Mupurisita o diyere, eci edi a di Mwana Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Mu mone okuru wa Melekisedeki! Shaanga Aburahama, aye mukwathsañuru shokuru o Maisiraele wa mu pire thso mudikumi kwinu yoikuru mu thsivaka eyi a ka kuparire mu mvo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Uno honi mu murao mo thsi di thsiraerera thso ku ninga ci mapurisita, awo anahoka a Livi, a shimbe thso mu dikumi kwaenthzo Maisiraele, shaanga ikare ci wahe shime tundererire kwa Aburahama. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melekisedeki ka a tundererire kwa Livi, unone wa shimbire thso mu dikumi kwa Aburahama no ku mu fiyawera, aye Aburahama oyu wa tamburire ekumbwethzo ya Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kwithsa yo ku kanyekapo, mukwa ku fiyawera mukuru kupita oyu na fiyaweriwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Mapurisita awa a na shimbanga thso mu dikumi po anu o ku twethsa kufa, unone Melekisedeki aye po twaa tongweriwa mu Mañoro ci aa yoya. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Twaa twethsa ku amba ci Livi, aye oyu na piwanga thso mu dikumi, naye wa pire thso mu dikumi kwa Melekisedeki ka Aburahama. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Inene Aburahama apa a ciwanine na Melekisedeki, Livi aye o ku shimbi ekarera mwirama ya mukwathsañuru wenthzi Aburahama.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa cipitura eci Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Uno honi ngeci kwononoka kwa waniwire kopurisita wa Livi omu a tambwerire anu murao, ine karo eyi ku fotiwera mupurisita o mu shayo thza Melekisedeki, kadi o mu shayo thza Aroni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Inene ngeci opurisita waa tutururiwa, no murao nawo waa roera ku piruriwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Inene Fumu wetu Yesu oyu tu ambaura yenthzi po nedi wa mu mukuta wao, omu mwa kana ku hanguriwa shaanga munu yofoci kwikara mupurisita ci a kwamene Nyambi pa katara. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Karo i na dimukiwa nawa ci Fumu wetu po shime erekiwire mu mukuta wa Juda, karo Mushe wa diyerire ku amba yo mapurisita ku tunderera omo mu mukuta.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Ombangi weyi waa monaharerera nawanawa pakuninga ci na ku keya mupurisita yumweya o ku pitura eci Melekisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ka na a hanguriwa kwikara Mupurisita kokuthza ko murao o thsiraerera thso ku kengerera pa thsikuta thsenthzi, unone na a hanguriwa kokoro o mwoyo o kukana kwipithsiwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Inene Mañoro aa amba ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“O mupurisita o diyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">mu shayo thza Melekisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Mweyo, thsiraerera thso kare keyi yopurisita na thsi pakeriwa ku mbadi, mukaci ko ku faratera kwathso no kukana ku kwathsa thsimweya. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Inene murao ka wa twethsire ku tenda thsinu thsipi nji thsipi kwikara thso kwononoka, unone okurupero ouwa kupita o kutanga na u keya, ou u tu twara po pepi na Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Karo Nyambi ka a i tendire ko kukana kucethzera ngoro! Unone ka kwekarangire kwethza ngoro mapurisita ou a hanguriwangire kwikara mapurisita. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Unone Nyambi wa hangurire Yesu kwikara mupurisita ko kwethza ngoro ou a ambire ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Fumu naethzi ngoro ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">ka a ku pirura eanekera yenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Owe po o mupurisita o diyere.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Mukaci ko kucethzera kwenthzi, Yesu yodiyo na tanarithsa thsiyuvano thsothsipe thso kupita thso kare.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kwekarire mapurisita owangi kukare, inene kufa kwa wa kwangithsire ku shumuna mwikwama yo yopurisita. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Unone pakuninga ci Yesu aa yoya diyere, opurisita wenthzi mbera ka u pu. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Mweyo, aye aa twethsa ku yoyithsa ko kuyara awa keya kwa Nyambi kenthzi, inene aye po wa ku yoya diyere ci a twethse ku wemanena kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Yesu yodiyo mupurisita shokuru oyu na roera oyu twa fotire, inene mukenu, ka a di no kapongonyi, wa kupira katamwethzi ko thsivi. Wa panduriwire kwanu wevi, no kuthzinekiwa pa thsituro thsoshokuru nene mu wiru. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Yesu ka a cishokire no mapurisita o shokuru amweya, inene ka ekarire ci shime a tupure eyambero diyuwa no diyuwa yo ku tetera evi, thso kutanga evi yo, mbeci honi evi yanu amweya. Inene aye po wa citupurire thsinda kwikara thsiyambero thsevi yanu rofoci karo ro mahurerero. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Murao wa Mushe wa hangurire mapurisita o shokuru awa faraterire ko kwikara anu. Uno honi munyima thzo murao, Nyambi wa hangurire Mwane ko ku cethzera, oyu na a tendiwa o kwononoka diyere.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mupurisita wetu shokuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Apa i nemana eyi ni amba po apa: tu di no Mupurisita Shokuru o kenge, oyu nekara ku rudyo ro ngunja thza Nyambi Shokuru mu wiru, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />aye oyu na kwamena mu Ndau thzo Shokenu, mu tende thzo shemwa ethzi a vapurire Fumu, kadi munu.<figure style="fig" alt="Tabernacle" file="lb00259b.tif" size="col" loc="Heb 8:1-2" copy="Knowles" ref="8.1-2">Tende</figure><verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Inene mupurisita shokuru yomuhe aa hangweriwanga ku tupura nupu neyambero, mweyo, no mupurisita wetu shokuru naye aa roera ku tupura thsimweya. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Uno honi nga pa a di pano pashi, nga tumba ekara mupurisita shaanga kamanana, inene ko a di mapurisita aa a na tupuranga nupu ko murao o thsijuda. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ekwama yopurisita eyi a tenda po thsikupuro no muthzimbimbi pohuma wenu yo ku wiru. Mofoci nedi yekarire kwa Mushe o ku fota ku umba tende, Nyambi wa mu raererire ci: “O tende enu yoihe ko ku piturithsa neyi wa monithsiwire pa mukinya.”<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Uno honi Yesu na a piwa ekwama yopurisita yoikuru mu thsivaka kupita ekwama yo, inene thsiyuvano ethsi a nemanena po thsikuru kupita thso kare, pakuninga ci thsiyuvano thsothsipe po thsaa shishiwa pekumbwethzo yoiwa kupita thso kutanga.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Inene thsiyuvano thso kutanga nga shime thsa pirire kapongonyi, nga ka kwa fotaharire karo thsiyuvano thso muthsidi. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Unone Nyambi wa wanine ci anu a di no kapongonyi, ngou a ambire ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Fumu a amba ci thsikati pepi thsi di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">ethsi na ku tenda thsiyuvano thsothsipe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">nanu o mu Isiraele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">nowa o mu Juda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ka thsa ku cishoka eci thsiyuvano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ethsi na tendire nakwathsañuru wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">diyuwa edi na wa kwatererire ku dyoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">no ku wa tangerera ku wa tundithsa mu ditunga dya Egepita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">pakuninga ci ka ruramine mu ku mamera thsiyuvano ethsi na cikwatireno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">na ni wa thsierera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">eyi yodiyo a amba Fumu.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Uno honi ethsi po thsodiyo thsiyuvano ethsi na ku tenda nanu a Isiraele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">munyima thzao mayuwa, eyi yodiyo a amba Fumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kenge na ku paka mirao thzange mu maano o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">no ku thzi ñora mu micima thzo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kenge na kwikara Nyambi wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">karo kenge a kwikara anuange.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Okwithsa oyu wa ku rongithsa muenthzenthzi o ditunga dyofoci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">nji ku ambera mwapenthzi ci: ‘O dimuke Fumu!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Inene wahe kenge a ku ni dimuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ku tatekera koyu shoonye shime ku ka kuma koyu shokuru.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Kenge na ku tetera omango wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">karo mbera ka ni vuruka evi yo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Nyambi eyi a ambera yo thsiyuvano thsothsipe po aa monithsa ci thsiyuvano thso kutanga thsi na pakiwa ku mbadi. Mweyo, ethsi thsi na kurupara no ku pakiwa ku mbadi thsi tamba ku pwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kurombera ko pano pashi noku ko mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Thsiyuvano thso kutanga thsekarire neraa yo ku rombera mofoci kengeyo no Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene thzo pano pashi thzo ku romberera ethzi a umbire anu. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />A umbire tende ethzi thzekarire no tupingwethzi twidi. Mu kapingwethzi ko kutanga omu mwekarire thsimeko thso kambarambara, tafure no makende aa a tupwerire Nyambi, kethsiwire Ndau thzo Shokenu. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Ku thsambwadiya thzo dimbatu dyo muthsidi kwekarire kapingwethzi ko muthsidi aka kethsiwire Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Omo kwekarire katara ko gauda apa a tumekerangire insense, no pongithsi thzo thsiyuvano ethzi thza thsikiwire kokuhe ko gauda. Mu pongithsi mwekarire kafuma ko gauda omu mwekarire maana, no mutaa wa Aroni ou wa shoshomenine mamuna, no mathzo o mawe apa pa ñoriwire maywi o thsiyuvano. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Peuru thzo pongithsi kwekarire ekupuro yo makeruvimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makeruvimi po nedi yumbiwa yo mu wiru eyi na i kwamenanga Nyambi eci tungeru twenthzi edi na tu mu kwamenanga.</char></note> o kutethzima kwa Nyambi, aa vapurire mando ao ku thsika ndau thzotetero o thsivi. Uno honi pano po ka tu twethsa ku tongonona eyi enu ko kuyara.<figure style="fig" alt="Ark in the most holy place" file="cn02092c.tif" size="col" loc="Heb 9:1-5" copy="Cook" ref="9.1-5">Pongithsi thzo thsiyuvano mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene</figure><verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Enu yoihe ou ya pwire ku roithsiwa, mapurisita engenangire mu kapingwethzi ko kutanga diyuwa no diyuwa ku ka tenda ekwama yo. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Unone mupurisita shokuru yodiyo pohuma wengenangire mu kapingwethzi ko muthsidi, muendo ofoci mu mwaka. Wengenangiremo nonyinga weyama ou a ka tupurangire mukaci kevi yenthzi nevi yanu eyi a tendire ko kukana ku dimuka. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Mweyo, Mupepo Oukenu wa monithsire ci dikuñwa dyo ku thza mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene di shime ku hokoriwa, pakuninga ci tende thzo kutanga shimbi thzekarerako.<verse eid="HEB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Ethsi po thsodiyo thsimoni-thso thso thsino thsikati, ethsi thsi monithsa ci nupu neyambero yemuna eyi i tupuriwa tumba i twethsa kwononokithsa mumoneno wa mukwakurombera. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Eyo shime ya piterire pohuma kwidya, enwa nedika yo mishovoshovo yo ku cikenithsa. Eyi po eraa pohuma yo ku kenithsa erama, eyi ya pakiwire shime ku kuma mu thsikati thso ku pirura enu.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyinga wa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Uno honi Krisitu na a keya, aye Mupurisita Shokuru wenu yoiwa eyi i diko pano. Naengena mu tende thzoshokuru thzo kwononoka nene thzo mu wiru. Ka thza kwamiwire ko moko anu, ku monithsa ci ka thzi di kuno ku kaye aka kombiwire. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Krisitu wengenine mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene muendo ofoci karo ro mahurerero. Kaengeninemo konyinga wekungwe nji o mapohoana, unone konyinga wenthzi shemwa, ku tu wanena kupaturiwa ko diyere.<verse eid="HEB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Onyinga o membe no mapoho, no mututwi o mandema ya shamawerangiwire anu o ku thsirekiwa ci a kenithsiwe erama yo. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Kwa ngepi honi kukenithsiwa oku wa ku kenithsa onyinga wa Krisitu mimoneno thzetu ci tu kwamene Nyambi oyu yoya, inene Krisitu wa citupurire yothsinda kwa Nyambi ko Mupepo Oukenu o diyere kwikara thsiyambero thsevi yetu thso kupira kapongonyi.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Mweyo, Krisitu yodiyo mukwakwimanena thsiyuvano thsothsipe ci awa ethsiwa kwa Nyambi a tambure thsiyauthzi thso diyere ethsi a kumbwethzire Nyambi. Inene Yesu wa fire ci a pature anu kumango ou a tendire mu thsiyuvano thso kutanga.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Keyi yo ndaano thzo munu, kwaa roera kwikara nombangi o ku monithsa ci thsinda wa fa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Ndaano thzaa kwamanga pohuma thsinda thsathzo o ku na fu, inene tumba thzi kwama thsinda thsathzo o ku yoya.<figure style="fig" alt="hyssop" file="hk00114b.tif" size="col" loc="Heb 9:16-22" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="9.16-22">Hisopa</figure><verse eid="HEB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Eyo ngeyi ya retithsire ci no thsiyuvano thso kutanga ka thsa shishiwire ko kupira onyinga. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Uno honi Mushe ou a manine ku amba eraerera yoihe yo murao kwanu wahe, wa shimbire onyinga o mapohoana nekungwe, wa u vandakanine no meyu no ku u shamawera pa vuka thzo murao nanu wahe ko ku cikwathsithsa mapukumuna o hisopa nohunga oukihu. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Wa ambire ci: “Ou po onyinga o thsiyuvano ethsi a mi raererire Nyambi ci mu thsi hengeke.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Mofoci kengeyo, karo wa shamawerire onyinga pa tende netenga yoihe eyi ya cikwathsithsiwangire mwirombero. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Karo kokuthza ko murao, ongi wenu yoihe yaa roera ku kenithsiwa konyinga, ko kupira ku via onyinga evi tumba i teteriwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiyambero thsa Krisitu thsaa tundithsa evi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Mweyo, kwa roerire ci enu yo mu thsikupuro thsenu yo ku wiru i kenithsiwe keyambero yo kenge. Unone enu yo mu wiru ayopo yaa roera eyambero yoiwa nene kupita eyi.<verse eid="HEB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Inene Krisitu ka engenine mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene ethzi thza kwamiwire ko moko anu, ethzi thza tendiwire mu thsikupuro thso ndau thzo shemwa thzo mu wiru, unone wa thzire mu wiru shemwa omu a na ka twimanena pa meho a Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ka engenine mu wiru ci a hukahukere rorungi ku citupura yothsinda, eci edi a nengenanga mupurisita shokuru mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene mwaka no mwaka nonyinga ou u ninga ci kadi wenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Nga kengeyo po, Krisitu shime ou nga na a nyanda rorungi ku tunda ku kumbiwa ko kaye. Uno honi naa monahara rofoci karo ro mahurerero ku mamaneneno ekati, ku na tundithsa evi ko ku citenda thsiyambero aye thsinda.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Eci dyodi a na roera munu yomuhe ku fa muendo ofoci, munyima no ku mu ratura Nyambi, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />mofoci, Krisitu naye wa tendiwire thsiyambero muendo ofoci ku tundithsa evi yanu owangi. Kenge a ku monahara ro muthsidi, kadi ku na tundithsa thsivi, unone ku na yoyithsa awa a na mu taterera.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Thsiyambero thsa Krisitu rofoci karo ro mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Murao o Thsijuda po muthzimbimbi pohuma wenu yoiwa eyi i keya, kadi cingwa thsikupuro thsayo shemwa. Mweyo, keyambero yao eyi i twarereriwa ku tendiwa mwaka no mwaka, tumba u dici kwononokithsa awa keya ku na rombera. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Eyo eyambero nga shime ya twethsire ku kenithsa anu kwivi yo rofoci karo ro mahurerero, nga ya pwithsiwire inene akwakurombera nga ka ciyuvangire karo kwikara no mirandu. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Uno honi eyi eyambero yaa wa vurukithsa mwaka no mwaka ci a di nevi. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Inene tumba i tawa ci onyinga o mapoho no membe u tundithse evi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Mweyo, Krisitu ou a keyire muno mu kaye wa amberire Nyambi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Ko fotire eyambero no nupu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">uno honi no ni roithsera erama.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ko nyanyukithsiwire ko nupu thzo kutumekera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nji keyambero yo ku tundithsa evi.”<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Ngou na ambire ci: “Yamono, naa thza ni ka kwame eshima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">yoe, Nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">eci edi i na ñoriwa yange mu vuka thzo Murao.”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Thso kutanga, Krisitu wa ambire ci: “Ko fotire, nji ku roerithsiwa keyambero no nupu, nji nupu thzo ku tumekera nji eyambero imweya yo ku tundithsa thsivi” shaanga ci eyo eyambero yaa tendiwa kokuthza ko murao. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Ngou a ambire karo ci: “O mone, naa keya na ni kwame eshima yoe.” Apo Nyambi aa pwithsa thsiyuvano thso kutanga no ku shisha thsothsipe. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Keyo eshima ya Nyambi, na tu kenithsiwa kwivi yetu ko thsiyambero thserama ya Yesu Krisitu ethsi thsa piwire muendo ofoci pohuma, karo ro mahurerero.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Mupurisita yomuhe aemananga diyuwa no diyuwa ku kwama ekwama yenthzi, ku hukahukera ku pa eyambero yo ku cipitura. Unone eyo eyambero tumba i twethsa ku tundithsa evi. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Uno honi Krisitu aye ou a manine ku pa thsiyambero thsevi rofoci, karo ro mahurerero, wekarire ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />ku taterera ethso thsikati shime ku ka kuma apa a ku tendera Nyambi akwethzimbo yenthzi thsipura thsedyato yenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Inene ko thsiyambero thsofoci na ononona diyere awa kenithsiwa kwivi yo.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Mupepo Oukenu nao waa tu pa ombangi, inene ethsi u amba po ethsi,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Ethsi thsodiyo thsiyuvano na ku ciyuvano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">munyima thzao mayuwa, Fumu aa amba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Kenge na ku paka mirao thzange mu micima thzo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">no ku thzi ñora mu maano o.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Ngou a ambire honi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Mbera ka ni vuruka karo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">evi yo nomango wo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Mweyo honi, apa ku na teteriwa evi, ka ku fotaharire karo thsiyambero thso ku tundithsa thsivi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tu henyenenu po pepi na Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Mweyo, andengenu, tu di honi nondume o kwingena mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene konyinga wa Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Na a tu yanthzurwera dikuñwa dyodipe, karo edi di yoya, edi na a yanthzurura ko dimbatu, ayo erama yenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Karo pakuninga ci tu di no mupurisita shokuru oyu na endithsa nthzio thza Nyambi, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />tu henyenenu po pepi na Nyambi ko micima thzo shemwa no ku tawa shemwa oku ku retiwa ko thsitawo. Inene micima thzetu na thzi kenithsiwa ku mimoneno thzothzimango, nerama eyi na i kenithsiwa ko meyu oawa. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tu tanarithse nene eyi tu na kurupera eyi tu pa ombangi wayo, inene oyu na a tu kumbwethza wa ku rurama. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tu cikaraethzenu o ku tu cikwathsa oandu ku shima no ku kwama yoiwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Twa thsia ku thzanga ku maciwaneno etu, eci edi a kwama amweya. Uno honi tu cikaraethzenu oandu eci edi mu na dimuka ci diyuwa dya Fumu dyaa kokera po pepi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Inene ngeci atwepo tu twarerera ku tenda thsivi ñenya munyima thzo ku dimuka oshemwa, apo honi po kwithsa karo thsiyambero ethsi nga thsi tu tundithsa thsivi, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />unone ku na tatereriwa pohuma raturo thza Nyambi thzo kuyapithsa, no dyangadiro edi dya ku na thzirithsa akwethzimbo yenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Munu yomuhe oyu wa kanine ku hengeka murao wa Mushe wepaiwire ko kukana ku yuveriwa ñeke kombangi wanu aidi nji ahatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Mwaa anekera ci thza ku kuma kupi honi humbithso ethzi thza ku roera munu o ku shwahura Mwana Nyambi, o ku shwahura onyinga o thsiyuvano thsa Nyambi ou na u mu kenithsa, o ku tuka Mupepo o thsihemo? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Inene tu na mu dimuka oyu wa ambire ci: “Ditoto po dyange, kenge na ku huthsera.” Karo ci: “Fumu kenge a ku ratura anuenthzi.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Yaa yapithsa shemwa ku wera mu moko a Nyambi oyu yoya!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mu vuruke aya mayuwa o ku matatekero munyima thzo ku tambura mwethzi, uya mwa cithzuire makando oakuru. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Pamweya shime mwaa tukathzaniweranga pa mbunga no ku nyandithsiwa. Ekati imweya mwemanenine mofoci nowa a tendiwire kengeyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Mwa yuverire ñekeñeke awa ekarire mu kamenga, karo mwa tamburire ko thsinyanyu ku nyangiwa enu yenu, pakuninga ci mwa dimukire ci mu di nenu yoiwa ku i pita, eyi i na mi taterera yo diyere.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Mweyo, mwa konthza okurupero wenu, inene kenge wa ku mi retera muyambo oukuru. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mwaa roera ku cithzua, ci yoihe mu tenda eshima ya Nyambi, nga mwa ku tambure eyi a kumbwethzire. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Inene eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Ku na thsiara thsikati thsothsipu pohuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">oyu na roera ku keya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">kenge a ku keya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">Ka a ku katapa.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Uno honi o muwawa wange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">kenge a ku yoya ko thsitawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">unone ngeci ayepo huka munyima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ka na ku mu nyanyukera.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Uno honi atwe po kadi cingwa twanu o ku huka munyima no ku nongithsiwa, unone tu di no thsitawo karo twaa yoyithsiwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Yo thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Thsitawo po ku tawa shemwa eyi i na kuruperiwa, no ku rakwa enu eyi tu kana ku mona. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Thsitawo thsodiyo thsa retithsire ci anu o ku kare a twethse ku shangariwa kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Ko thsitawo twaa yuvithsithsa ci kaye kombiwire ko diywi dya Nyambi, ci eyi i moniwa ka ya tendiwire penu yo ku twethsa ku moniwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ko thsitawo Abele wa tupwerire Nyambi thsiyambero thsothsiwa kupita thsa Kaine. Karo ko thsitawo Abele wa shangariwire ci munu o muwawa, inene Nyambi wa tamburire ekunda yenthzi. Ko thsitawo, Abele ko ku amba a amba no pano tu di, shaanga ikare ci wa fa kare.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Ko thsitawo Enoke ka a fire, unone shime a twariwire ku wiru o ku di oyumi. Ka a waniwire karo, inene Nyambi wa mu shimbire. O ku shime ku twariwa ku wiru, Mañoro aa monithsa ci oyu munu wa shangariwire kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Tumba i tawa ku roerithsa Nyambi ko kupira thsitawo. Inene o ku keya kwa Nyambi aa roera ku tawa ci Nyambi kwaa di, no ku tawa ci aa pa muyambo awa a na mu fotafota nene.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nedi ko thsitawo Nuwe ou a yuverire Nyambi ou a mu nomenithsire yenu o ku i shime ku monahara. Wa umbire areka ku yoyithsa rupathsi rwenthzi ku dimina dyodikuru. Ko thsitawo thsenthzi wa raturire kaye, karo wa tamburire owawa ou u na waniwa ko thsitawo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Nedi ko thsitawo Aburahama ou a yuverire Nyambi ou a mwithsire ci a thze ku ditunga edi a mu kumbwethzire Nyambi ci kenge mba a di mu pa. Wa katukire no ku thza, shaanga ci ka a dimukire oku a thzire. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ko thsitawo Aburahama wa thzire no ku ka tunga eci mutundakure muya mu ditunga a mu kumbwethzire Nyambi. Wa ka yoyire mu matende, karo a Isaka na Jakovo nawo a yoyiremo mu matende, awa tamburire ethso thsikumbwethzo eci Aburahama. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Shime a tatererire thsikuña thso mishisho, ethsi thsa funderiwire no ku umbiwa kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ko thsitawo Aburahama wa twethsire kwereka mwana shaanga ci wa kuruparire nene, karo munuwenthzi Sara wekarire mvumi. Eyi ya dikarire pakuninga ci wa kuruperire Nyambi ci kenge a ku mu pa eyi a mu kumbwethzire.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amweya aa thzi toroka ci: “Ko thsitawo wa tamburire okoro o ku thza poremu, shaanga ci wekarire mvumi karo o ku na kurupara nene, pakuninga ci wa kuruperire Nyambi kenge a ku mu pa eyi a mu kumbwethzire.”</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Mweyo, kwa Aburahama, oyu wekarire eci wa kufa, ku kwenthzi aye yofoci kwa tundire anahoka owangi nene eci matungwethzi o ku wiru, nji eci ruheke ro pa diya dyo diwate.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Awa anu awa wahe a fererire mu thsitawo. Ka tamburire eyi a kumbwethziwire, unone a i kambekethzire pohuma no ku i nyanyukera o kwa di kokure, no ku citawera ci nedi matundakure karo nedi enda mu kaye. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Anu o ku amba kengeyo aa monithsa ci ko ku fota a fota ditunga dyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Nga shime a anekerangire yo diya ditunga muya a ka tundire, nga a hukire. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Uno honi shime a fotire pohuma ditunga dyodiwa kupita kaye, adyo dyo ku wiru. Mweyo, Nyambi ka a fire honyi kwithsiwa ci Nyambi wo, inene na a wa roithsera kare thsikuña.<figure style="fig" alt="Abraham and Isaac" file="co00663b.tif" size="col" loc="Heb 11:17-19" copy="Cook" ref="11.17-19">Aburahama na Isaka</figure><verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ko thsitawo Aburahama wa tupurire mwanenthzi Isaka kwikara thsiyambero ou a mu erekire Nyambi. Aburahama oyu wa tamburire ekumbwethzo ya Nyambi wa ciroithserire ku tenda thsiyambero mwanenthzi pakamutwa Isaka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />shaanga ci Nyambi shime a mu amberire ci: “Kwa Isaka ko kwa ku tunderera anahoka oe.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Aburahama shime a anekerire ci Isaka shaanga nga waa fire, Nyambi nga wa twethsire ku mu pindura kwafu. Mweyo, ko dikuñwa dyo kengeyo, Aburahama wa tamburire mwanenthzi eci o kupinduka kwafu.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Ko thsitawo Isaka wa fiyawerire Jakovo na Isau keyi yo mwoyo wo o ku rupara.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ko thsitawo Jakovo o ku kokangera, wa fiyawerire ana Josefa aidi, wa thsakaterire pa mutaa wenthzi o ku rombera Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Ko thsitawo Josefa o ku di po pepi no ku fa wa ambire keyi yo diyaru dyo Maisiraele mu Egepita, wa wa pire thsiraerera ci a ku shimbe eshoko yenthzi ou mba yaruka mu Egepita.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Ko thsitawo ashemi a Mushe a mu horekire maonda ahatu ku tunda pa kwerekiwa, inene shime a mu monine ci nedi mwana o muwa nene, karo ka yapire thsiraerera thsa fumu.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ko thsitawo Mushe ou a kurire, wa kanine kwithsiwa ci mwana mwana Faro o mbuyama. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Wa cihangwerire ku nyandera pofoci no mbunga thza Nyambi, kupita ecikora yo thsivi yo mu thsikati thsothsipu. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Wa anekerire ci ku di nawa ku tukathzaniwera Krisitu kupita rufumo ro mu Egepita, inene shime a tatererire muyambo ou mba a tambura ku rupara. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Ko thsitawo Mushe wa tundire mu Egepita ko kukana ku yapa oanthzi wa fumu. Uno honi wekarire no muooto pakuninga ci shime a monine Nyambi shimoniwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Karo ko thsitawo Mushe wa tendire Paseka no ku raerera Maisiraele ci a wethse onyinga pa mathsero o manthzio o, ci kangeru ko difu katere kepae edi wo wakwerume.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ko thsitawo Maisiraele a cinakanine Diwate Dyodikihu ko ku enda pa mburundumburundu, unone Maegepita ou a erekire ku wa shupwera, wahe a fire ku meyu.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ko thsitawo mamota a Jeriko a wire, munyima thzo ku a thzinguruka Maisiraele mayuwa o mutanu na edi.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ko thsitawo Rahaba o diherehere ka a fire no waya a kanine ku yuvera Nyambi, inene shime a tamburire nawa tuya tunenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ene ni shumune ku amba nji? Ka ni di no thsikati thso ku amba keyi ya Gidioni na Baraki, ya Samisoni na Jefuta, neyi ya Davida na Samuele nakwakukethza. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Ko thsitawo awa anu a kuparire matunga, a tendire yoiwawa no ku wana eyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi. A vukire tunwa to nyime. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />A thzimine midiro thzothzikoro, karo a parire ku kwipaiwa no myere. A tanarithsiwire mu kufaratera kwo, karo a tanarire mu mvo shime ku kuma pa ku othza mashwarare o matundakure. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Ko thsitawo ambuyama amweya a pindweriwire afu wo kwafu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Amweya a yuvithsiwire kukora pa ku kana kwo ku tawa ku rukururiwa. A tendire kengeyo ko ku fota ci nga a ku pindukere mwoyo ouwa munyima thzo ku fa. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Amweya ku kwo a teururiwire no ku mwashuriwa, awa amweya angiwire no madyenge no ku pakiwa mu kamenga. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Epaiwire ko ku povauriwa no mawe, a tetauriwire epinthzi idi idi no thsaha, amweya epaiwire no myere. Amweya a yembaerire o kwa na vata pohuma etumba yo mangu no membe, a pirukire ahepwe, a nyandithsiwire no ku tendiwa dyodimango. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Awa anu kaye ka ka wa roerire! Shime a yembaerire mu makunguthsitu no mu mikinya, no ku yoya mu mahorongo no mu mateke o mu muve.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Awa anu wahe ekarire no kapupo kokawa mukaci ko thsitawo thso, unone kwithsa shaanga yofoci ku kwo oyu wa tamburire eyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Inene Nyambi wa tu cekerire enu yoiwa kupita eyo, ci nga a ku tendiwa o kwononoka ko kupira atwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyambi Tata wetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci tu na thzingurukiwa ku mungi o mambangi, tu thsienu yoihe eyi i na tu remena, karo tu thsienu thsivi ethsi thsi na tu rambera. Tu cirenu ko muooto shime ku ka kuma ku mamaneneno o rakaraka ethzi thzi na tu taterera. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Tu kengererenu kwa Yesu, aye mutateki no mukwakwononona thsitawo thsetu. Inene mukaci ko thsinyanyu ethsi thsa mu tatererire, wa cithzuire pa mbinda, karo ka a fire honyi ku fera pa mbinda. Pano honi nekara ku rudyo ro ngunja thza Nyambi. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Mu anekere Yesu, oyu wa cithzuire orwithsi ku tunderera kwanu wevi, ci katere mwa ku aye nji ku huka munyima. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mu mvo thzenu thzo ku kanena thsivi ka na mu kumupo mu thsikati thso kuninga ci shime ku paiwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Ene mu na vurama maywi otanarithso aya a mi amberire Nyambi eci munu oyu thsiurura anenthzi? Wa ambire ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwanange, wa tendithsa dipome yoihe a ku orora Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">karo wa huka munyima yoihe a ku thsiurura.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Inene Fumu wa ku orora oyu a shima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">no ku humbithsa oyu a na tambura ci mwanenthzi.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Mu cithzue mwikarupa inene mwaa ororiwa. Mu i shimbe ci Nyambi oyu mi tenda kengeyo. Ene kwaa di mwana oyu wa kana ku ororiwa kwa tata wenthzi nji? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ngeci Nyambi ka a mi ororangire eci edi a na ororanga anenthzi wahe, apo mu dimuke ci kadi mwanenthzi shemwa unone mwana o mu muhonyi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kadi eyo pohuma, unone twekarire natata wetu o pano pashi awa tu ororire, karo twa wa remekire. Ene kadi twaa roera ku cihuthsa nene kushi thza Tata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po thzaa amba ci “Tata o mipepo.”</char></note> wetu o ku wiru ci tu yoye?<verse eid="HEB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Atata wetu o pano pashi na tu orora thsikati thsothsipu kokuthza komu na monena ci nga dyo tu na roera ku yoya. Uno honi Nyambi aye aa tu orora ku tu kwathsa ci nga tu ciere mukenu wenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mu thsikati thso ku ororiwa, munu ka a ciyuvangire nawa, unone aa yuvanga kukora. Uno honi munyima yaa reta ima yo thsiyaro nowawa kowa na fundithsiwa modi dikuñwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Mweyo, mu yerure moko enu aa a kunthza, karo mu tanarithse manwi enu aa a nderathzoka. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Mu orore makuñwa edyato yenu ci thsikunga thsa kuruka<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Mita 4.26</ref>. </char></note>, unone thsi pore.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa kana thsihemo thsa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mu koñomeke ku yoya ko thsiyaro nanu wahe no ku yoya mwoyo oukenu, inene o kukana kukena ka ku mona Fumu. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mu mamere ci kwa waniwa ku kwenu oyu wa ku kwanga ku tambura thsihemo thsa Nyambi, karo mu mamere ci kwa tunguka mu kaci kenu mutungu o ndurungera no ku reta okaru, no ku thsireka anu owangi. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mu mamere ci kwa waniwa ku kwenu o ruthziho nji shiremeka Nyambi eci Isau oyu wa urithsire oroero wenthzi o wedi ko mudyero ofoci. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mu na dimuka namwe ci munyima thzeyi, Isau ou a fotire ci a tambure ethso thsiyauthzi kwa tata wenthzi, tata wenthzi wa mu kanenine. Ka ya tawire ci a cere eyi a tendire shaanga ci wa direrire nene ethso thsiyauthzi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Ka na mu kumu ku thsinu thso ku twethsa ku kwatiwa, nji ku ndau thzo mudiro ou u yuuma, nji mirema, nji thsithsike, nji kakundukundu nji dyungu, eci edi yekarire ku Maisiraele pa mukinya wa Sinai. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />A yuvire muvumo o torombita no diywi dyo ku yapithsa nene ku ninga ci mane awa a di yuvire a rombire Nyambi ci a amba karo. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Inene ka twethsire ku cithzua thsiraerera thso ku ninga ci: “Shaanga thsikondwama nga athsopo thsi kunyuna ku mukinya, thsaa roera ku povauriwa no mawe ku thsipaa.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Eyi ya monaharire ya yapithsire nene ku ninga ci mane shaanga Mushe wa ambire ci: “Ni na yapa no ku tutuma!”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Uno honi amwe po na mu keya ku Mukinya wa Sione, athso thsikuña thsa Nyambi oyu yoya, aye Yerusalema o ku wiru, no ku tukore na tukore to tungeru mu thsiciwano thso thsinyanyu. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Na mu keya ku thsiciwano thsedi a Nyambi awa a na ñoriwa mathzina o mu wiru. Karo na mu keya kwa Nyambi aye mukwakuratura anu wahe no ku mipepo thzanu owawawa awa na tendiwa o kwononoka. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Na mu keya kwa Yesu mukwakwimanena thsiyuvano thsothsipe, karo na mu keya kunyinga ou wa shamauriwire, ou u amba yoiwa kupita onyinga wa Abele.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Mu mamere ci katere mu kane oyu amba! Inene ngeci waya a kanine ku teerera ya Mushe aye kanganda ko pano pashi ka parire, atwe ne ngepi twa ku para ngeci twaa kana oyu tu nomenithsa ku tunderera ku wiru? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Nyambi uya a ambire pa Mukinya wa Sinai diywi dyenthzi dya ngangamithsire kaye. Uno honi, pano naa kumbwethza ci: “Kenge na ku hukera ku ngangamithsa kaye, karo kadi kaye pohuma unone no diwiru kengeyo.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Pa ku amba ci “ku hukera” yaa monithsa nawa ci eyi yombiwire yoihe kenge ya ku ngangamithsiwa no ku tundithsiwa, ci yo kukana ku twethsa ku ngangamithsiwa ya ku thsiare.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci twaa tambura kutumina ko kukana ku twethsa ku ngangamithsiwa, tu kandererenu no ku rombera Nyambi komu ku na roera ko direma no ku yapa. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Inene Nyambi wetu yodiyo mudiro ou u ñotokithsa.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Dyo ku roerithsa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Mu twarerere mu ku cishima oandu eci ana o dira dyofoci. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mwa vurama ku tambura nawa enda mu myanda thzenu, inene ko ku tambura enda, anu amweya a tamburire tungeru ko kukana ku i dimuka. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mu vuruke awa di mu kamenga, eci mo mu di namwe. Karo mu vuruke awa tendiwa omango, eci yaa tendiwa mwirama yenu.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Maruo a remekiwe kwanu wahe, karo odidi o maruo wa thsirekiwa. Inene Nyambi kenge a ku ratura akwaruthziho nakwamirembe. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mwa shima nene madi mu myoyo thzenu, karo mu rakwe eyi mu di nayo, inene Nyambi wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Mbera ka ni ku thsii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">karo mbera ka ni ku thsierera.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Mweyo, twaa twethsa ku amba kondume ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Fumu yodiyo mukwathsi wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">ka na ku yapa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Thsine ethsi nga a ni tenda munu?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mu vuruke aendithsi enu awa tangire ku mi rongithsa diywi dya Nyambi. Mu anekere eyi na i tundu pa muyoyero wo, karo mu temunune thsitawo thso. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Krisitu ka a wana mamiru, dyodi na ekara yana, no rero dyo a di, karo dyaa kwikara diyere.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Mwa pambanithsiwa kwirongithsa yayo yo kucithsiathsia, inene ku di nawa ci micima thzenu thzi tanarithsiwe ku thsihemo, kadi kwidya yedika eyi i ninga ci ka i kwathsire thsimweya awa na i shupwera.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Tu di no katara keyambero apa a na kana ku roera ku dya awa a na kwamena mu tende thzerombero.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Inene mupurisita shokuru aa twaranga onyinga weyama mu Ndau thzo Shokenu Nene kwikara thsiyambero thso thsivi, unone erama yeyo eyama yaa tumekeriwanga pora thzo thsirombo. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Mofoci, no Yesu naye wa fererire pora thzo thsikuña ku kenithsa anu kwivi yo konyinga wenthzi. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Mweyo, tu thzenu ku kwenthzi pora thzo thsirombo tu ka shimbe natwe matuka aa a cithzuire. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Inene ka tu di no thsikuña thso diyere muno mu kaye, unone twaa taterera thsikuña ethsi thsi keya.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Mweyo, tu twarererenu ku tupura thsiyambero thso ku shangara Nyambi ka Yesu, tu citawerenu dithzina dyenthzi ko tunwa twetu. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Mwa vurama ku tenda yoiwa no ku kwathsa awa a na piri, inene eyo yodiyo eyambero eyi i roerithsa Nyambi.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Mu yuvere aendithsi enu no ku cipaka kushi thzo, inene aa nyunga myoyo thzenu, karo aa roera ku citawera kwa Nyambi keyi yekwama yo. Mu kwame eyi ci myoyo thzo thzikare thzo thsinyanyu kadi thzo thsishiro, inene eyo nga ka ya ku mi kwathsa thsimweya.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mu tu romberere, inene tu na dimuka shemwa ci mimoneno thzetu thziwa, karo twaa cikumbwethza ku yoya mwoyo o direma thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Naa koñomeka ku mi romba ci mu ni romberere kwa Nyambi ci na ku huke wanguwangu oko ku kwenu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufiyawera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nyambi o thsiyaro oyu na a pindura Fumu wetu Yesu kwafu, aye Mudithsani Shokuru o mangu, konyinga wenthzi ou u tanarithsa thsiyuvano thso diyere, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />a mi pe enu yoihe yoiwa ci nga mu twethse ku tenda eshima yenthzi. Karo a tende mu mwetu ka Yesu Krisitu yo ku mu roerithsa. Kutethzima kwikare ku kwenthzi diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi o mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Andengenu, naa mi adikanena ci mu teerere nawa aa maywi otanarithso aa ni na mi ñorera, shaanga ci shime ni naa mi ñorera ko wipi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Naa mi dimukithsa ci muenthzetu Timoti na a punithsiwa mu kamenga. Ngeci waa ku na kume wangu kuno, kenge na ku keya nenthzi ku na mi mona.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mu ni vumenenene aendithsi enu wahe nakwakutawa wahe. Akwakutawa o ku Itali aa mi vumenena.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsikare nenu mwahe.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>